&lt;h2&gt;More windows, an SFTP filter, and a tidier toolbar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Open more than one window, filter the SFTP folder on screen, and choose which panel buttons show.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Window&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;File → New Window (⌘⇧N) opens another window with its own tabs.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Filter the folder&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Press ⌘F in an SFTP panel to show only the names that match, such as *.log.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Choose panel buttons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Right-click a panel&amp;#x27;s title bar or use More → Customize Toolbar to pick and order its buttons.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Close active sessions before updating. Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.15"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
